Error [E0102]: `Bool` has no static method `to_string`
  --> tests/ui/primitive_static_to_string.jet:2:16
    |
  2 |     print(Bool.to_string())
    |                ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: built-in types expose only their documented static methods
 Fix: call a documented static method on `Bool`, or call `.to_string()` on a value that provides it

